WEBVTT

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:04.000
Tada Coffee Shop

00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:06.830
Meow, meow!

00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:08.620
Meow!

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:11.290
My name is Nyanko Big.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:16.000
This guy sleeping with a dopey face is Mitsuyoshi Tada.

00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:19.250
He saved my life.

00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:22.160
Meow! Meow!

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:31.330
Time sure flies. It's already been ten years...

00:00:34.830 --> 00:00:35.700
Meow.

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:40.500
Meow!

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:46.540
The target shows no response.

00:00:48.410 --> 00:00:50.500
Meow, meow, meow, meow!

00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:52.330
I'm not playing games here!

00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:54.660
Meow?!

00:00:55.790 --> 00:00:58.040
I'm moving to the final phase now.

00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:00.290
Mraow!

00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:04.750
You're so heavy!

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:09.250
You've put on some weight again, haven't you?!

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:14.410
Hmph, mission accomplished.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:19.250
Meow!

00:01:19.790 --> 00:01:22.750
Meow! Meow!

00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:24.500
Roster
Meals
Laundry
Nyanko's, too!
Hang Dry!
Big Brother
Yui
Grandpa
Cleaning
Nyanko's litter box, too!

00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:24.500
Just hold on.

00:01:23.410 --> 00:01:24.500
Meow!

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:26.870
Meow!

00:01:27.950 --> 00:01:31.290
Morning, Big Bro! I'm gonna be late, so I'll be off now!

00:01:31.660 --> 00:01:33.290
See you later!

00:01:33.620 --> 00:01:34.410
Okay.

00:01:34.410 --> 00:01:35.330
Meow.

00:01:42.410 --> 00:01:48.250
Dad, Mom, Mitsuyoshi grew up to be
a fine young man, didn't he?

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:52.160
It's thanks to the fact that
I've always watched over him.

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:53.750
Meow!

00:01:56.580 --> 00:01:58.370
Tch. Kibbles again?!

00:01:59.950 --> 00:02:02.250
You really love that food.

00:02:02.250 --> 00:02:03.790
What?!

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:11.370
Oh, Tada-kun, good morning!

00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:15.080
Morning.

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:22.450
We're going to have a photography meeting
this afternoon, right? I'm looking forward to it!

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:22.450
I've been seeing this blondie and redhead lately.

00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:24.000
These girls are really fine, but...

00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:23.250
Yeah.

00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:27.540
Ah! Nyanko Big-san, good morning!

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:28.830
...like me, Mitsuyoshi doesn't get smitten with girls.

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:30.450
Isn't that right?

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:31.500
Meow?

00:02:32.370 --> 00:02:36.910
That's all you're getting to eat.
You've been really heavy lately.

00:02:36.910 --> 00:02:39.120
I'm not talking about food!

00:02:41.580 --> 00:02:42.830
This scent!

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:46.750
Your breakfast is ready.

00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:48.040
Awesome!

00:02:48.370 --> 00:02:49.290
Fish!

00:02:50.120 --> 00:02:51.040
See you later!

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:51.580
'Kay.

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:52.290
Fish!

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:53.250
Fish!

00:02:53.580 --> 00:02:54.450
Fish!

00:02:56.330 --> 00:02:59.620
Meow!

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:01.410
Ah...!

00:03:02.830 --> 00:03:04.000
Nyanko Big!

00:03:10.580 --> 00:03:16.700
Tada Never Falls in Love

00:03:18.450 --> 00:03:21.040
Hey, look over here

00:03:21.450 --> 00:03:24.450
The viewfinder is always set

00:03:24.450 --> 00:03:26.870
If it isn't of you, then it doesn't appeal to me

00:03:26.870 --> 00:03:30.040
Did something happen to me?

00:03:30.790 --> 00:03:33.370
I walked past my friends

00:03:33.620 --> 00:03:36.500
And my close friend, whom I keep missing

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:39.000
It's a turbulent world

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:43.370
By the time I realized it, the world was like a rainbow

00:03:43.370 --> 00:03:46.790
Oh, seasons, stop

00:03:46.790 --> 00:03:52.910
In the photos of our time together

00:03:52.910 --> 00:03:58.290
Every single thing is shining brightly

00:03:58.620 --> 00:04:04.370
Hey, there's one thing I want to tell you

00:04:04.370 --> 00:04:11.450
I can't stop it or hide it anymore; that feeling is right here

00:04:11.450 --> 00:04:19.700
Baby, before you vanish into this film we call "memories"

00:04:20.160 --> 00:04:24.450
There's something I want to tell you

00:04:26.450 --> 00:04:30.200
"I'm in love with you now"

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:40.040
You Love That

00:04:40.040 --> 00:04:43.290
Tada Coffee Shop

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:44.870
Tada-kun! How's Nyanko Big-san?!

00:04:44.870 --> 00:04:48.250
Oh, well, he seems fine...

00:04:49.790 --> 00:04:51.410
How could that happen to me?

00:04:51.410 --> 00:04:53.870
It seems I'm somewhat out of shape.

00:04:53.870 --> 00:04:55.250
Ow...!

00:04:56.120 --> 00:04:58.580
Are you all right? Does it hurt anywhere?

00:04:57.870 --> 00:04:59.620
Purr, purr, purr...

00:04:58.790 --> 00:05:00.160
This pain is nothing.

00:05:00.830 --> 00:05:01.660
Meow?!

00:05:01.660 --> 00:05:04.500
Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow!

00:05:02.790 --> 00:05:04.500
Looks like his legs are okay, too.

00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:05.790
S-stop it!

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:08.950
He doesn't have a problem with landing, either.

00:05:08.950 --> 00:05:09.790
Of course, I don't!

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:11.290
Thank goodness!

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:13.750
Where is Grandpa-san?

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:14.910
He's out.

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:17.950
Then, are you the only one working
at the coffee shop, Tada-kun?

00:05:17.950 --> 00:05:23.080
Saturday mornings are relatively quiet.
And Grandpa will be back in the afternoon, so...

00:05:24.700 --> 00:05:26.580
That's amazing, isn't it, Alec?!

00:05:26.580 --> 00:05:27.700
Yes, it is.

00:05:28.040 --> 00:05:31.080
That's right. Mitsuyoshi is an amazing guy.

00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:38.410
He's helped out ever since he was a little tyke and
brews coffee just as well as Coffee Master Shozo.

00:05:39.040 --> 00:05:42.200
He's studied hard while taking care of Yui.

00:05:42.910 --> 00:05:45.950
He's aiming to become a photographer,
and he works hard at it every day.

00:05:47.540 --> 00:05:51.410
That's also thanks to the fact that
I've been watching over him, isn't it?

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:54.750
Nyanko Big, it's time for us to open.

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:57.000
Flip over the sign.

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:57.870
Huh?!

00:05:58.290 --> 00:06:01.250
Nyanko Big-san, can do such a thing?!

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:03.160
I most certainly cannot!

00:06:03.160 --> 00:06:06.620
If I keep saying it for the time being,
he might be able to one of these days.

00:06:08.330 --> 00:06:10.950
Are you so short-handed that
you'd even want your cat to help?

00:06:10.950 --> 00:06:13.040
If he can help. Right?

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:13.750
No thanks.

00:06:15.250 --> 00:06:18.660
Then, please allow me to help you instead!

00:06:18.660 --> 00:06:19.500
Huh?

00:06:19.500 --> 00:06:20.330
Teresa...

00:06:20.330 --> 00:06:21.040
Alec!

00:06:21.410 --> 00:06:23.120
Anything is an experience!

00:06:26.830 --> 00:06:30.120
Please allow us both to help,
if it isn't inconvenient for you.

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:32.160
That'd make things easier for me, but...

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:38.000
I'll open the shop! I look forward to working with you!

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:39.250
Yeah.

00:06:45.950 --> 00:06:46.910
Welcome!

00:06:46.910 --> 00:06:48.870
Heya, Mitsuyoshi!

00:06:48.870 --> 00:06:51.200
I'd like a morning set and the usual!

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:54.950
One morning set, one special coffee jelly,
and one blended coffee.

00:06:54.950 --> 00:06:55.830
Okay!

00:06:55.830 --> 00:06:59.700
Huh? If it isn't Teresa-chan and Alec! What's going on?!

00:07:00.040 --> 00:07:01.410
We are helping out!

00:07:01.410 --> 00:07:02.450
For reals?!

00:07:03.450 --> 00:07:06.620
Hey, Nyanko Big! Wanna go at it today?!

00:07:06.620 --> 00:07:07.870
Go home, kid!

00:07:09.540 --> 00:07:10.200
Whoa!

00:07:12.750 --> 00:07:13.790
Safe by a hair!

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:18.120
A Trepid Nyanko Big update.

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:23.450
Geez. We've known each other for so long,
so why won't you let your guard down with me?

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:21.250
Hiss!

00:07:21.700 --> 00:07:25.000
This annoying guy is Kaoru Ijuin.

00:07:23.450 --> 00:07:25.580
I don't think he'll ever change.

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:28.870
He's Mitsuyoshi's childhood friend,
and he always hangs out at the coffee shop.

00:07:26.080 --> 00:07:27.660
You think so?

00:07:28.870 --> 00:07:31.750
I won't give up, Nyanko Big!

00:07:29.120 --> 00:07:31.750
He's a spoiled brat whose family owns an old
Japanese-style restaurant in the neighborhood.

00:07:32.660 --> 00:07:33.620
Welcome.

00:07:33.080 --> 00:07:34.250
Welcome!

00:07:35.250 --> 00:07:40.540
He's one of our regulars.
His face has "hit man" written all over it.

00:07:45.620 --> 00:07:48.040
Yay! It's Rainbow Shogun!

00:07:48.040 --> 00:07:50.000
Rainbow Shogun.

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:56.120
State one color of the rainbow!

00:07:56.660 --> 00:07:58.620
Uh... blue.

00:07:59.950 --> 00:08:03.540
The color of the rainbow is rainbow! Meet your maker!

00:08:10.790 --> 00:08:13.370
Always make your heart rainbow!

00:08:14.430 --> 00:08:15.300
To be continued

00:08:16.200 --> 00:08:18.660
Always make your heart rainbow!

00:08:17.410 --> 00:08:18.660
...rainbow!

00:08:21.750 --> 00:08:23.620
Ah, welcome!

00:08:24.040 --> 00:08:29.540
Tada Coffee Shop

00:08:24.370 --> 00:08:26.620
Hello. Are you open?

00:08:26.620 --> 00:08:28.250
A-are you okay with this place?

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:29.200
Yes! Please sit wherever you'd like!

00:08:28.250 --> 00:08:29.200
Yeah.

00:08:31.080 --> 00:08:33.830
Are you helping out here today?

00:08:31.620 --> 00:08:36.620
I met this elderly couple ten years ago.

00:08:33.830 --> 00:08:37.910
Yes! Grandpa-san is out, so I'm helping out!

00:08:36.620 --> 00:08:37.910
Meow.

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:43.120
I'd like one egg sandwich, one kappa sandwich,
and two blended coffees.

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:44.410
Are you okay with that?

00:08:44.410 --> 00:08:45.160
Yeah.

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:46.950
That's all.

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:48.540
Got it!

00:08:50.330 --> 00:08:51.540
Here's their order.

00:08:50.660 --> 00:08:53.370
They remind me of when we were their age.

00:08:51.540 --> 00:08:52.370
Okay.

00:08:52.700 --> 00:08:56.040
One egg sandwich, one kappa sandwich,
and two blended coffees!

00:08:53.370 --> 00:08:54.410
Yeah.

00:08:56.200 --> 00:08:59.330
Tada Coffee Shop

00:08:56.500 --> 00:08:57.370
Okay.

00:08:57.910 --> 00:08:59.040
Tada-kun.

00:08:59.790 --> 00:09:01.580
What is a kappa sandwich?

00:09:00.660 --> 00:09:01.580
Kappa?!

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:03.830
It's a cucumber sandwich.

00:09:04.040 --> 00:09:07.700
By the way, "kappa" is the name
of a Japanese river sprite.

00:09:07.700 --> 00:09:09.450
Kappa

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:09.450
It's a river sprite?!

00:09:09.790 --> 00:09:11.580
What does it have to do with cucumbers?!

00:09:11.580 --> 00:09:14.160
Huh?! Why cucumbers, Mitsuyoshi?

00:09:14.500 --> 00:09:16.500
It's 'cause kappa love cucumbers.

00:09:16.500 --> 00:09:17.580
Seriously?!

00:09:17.580 --> 00:09:19.200
You didn't know that?

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:20.950
E-excuse me!

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:21.830
Yes?!

00:09:22.540 --> 00:09:24.620
Um, I'd like an iced café au lait.

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:26.540
M-me, too. I'd like the same thing.

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:31.330
Okay! Two iced café au laits.
Please give us a few minutes.

00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:36.410
This is the first time that boy brought a girl here.

00:09:39.950 --> 00:09:40.750
Um...!

00:09:40.750 --> 00:09:41.450
Ah!

00:09:51.870 --> 00:09:52.950
Whoa!

00:09:54.870 --> 00:09:56.080
I sincerely appreciate it!

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:05.290
Nice.

00:10:07.660 --> 00:10:08.950
U-um...!

00:10:09.370 --> 00:10:10.160
Yes?

00:10:11.330 --> 00:10:15.540
I heard that if a man and a woman look each other
in the eyes for eight seconds, they'll fall in love.

00:10:15.830 --> 00:10:19.910
Mitsuyoshi, Pin-senpai asked if having
the photography meeting in the afternoon was fine.

00:10:19.910 --> 00:10:20.700
Yeah.

00:10:21.080 --> 00:10:22.580
Are you okay with that, Teresa-chan and Alec?

00:10:22.580 --> 00:10:23.660
Of course!

00:10:26.790 --> 00:10:28.000
They've fallen in love.

00:10:32.370 --> 00:10:34.160
Thank you for your patronage!

00:10:35.500 --> 00:10:36.620
Good work.

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:39.200
Thanks, you two. You were a big help.

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:42.370
I'll brew some coffee, so let's take a break.

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:43.290
Okay!

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:51.700
What would you like? Please request
if you'd prefer strong-tasting or aromatic coffee.

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:52.830
Teresa.

00:10:53.580 --> 00:10:56.870
Oh, right! I had these things!

00:11:00.290 --> 00:11:01.330
What are those?!

00:11:01.950 --> 00:11:03.870
They're hot chocolate spoons.

00:11:04.160 --> 00:11:08.870
If you put one in hot milk or coffee,
you can enjoy a chocolate drink.

00:11:09.200 --> 00:11:10.330
Huh...

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:11.950
Add chocolate in coffee?!

00:11:11.950 --> 00:11:12.790
Yes!

00:11:12.790 --> 00:11:15.620
We often drink coffee this way in Larsenburg.

00:11:15.950 --> 00:11:18.830
I thought I'd let everyone enjoy it, too!

00:11:18.830 --> 00:11:20.580
It sounds delicious!

00:11:20.580 --> 00:11:21.580
This is great!

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:24.290
Mitsuyoshi, I'd like another cup of coffee!

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:27.250
Then, I'll make coffee that'll pair well with chocolate.

00:11:27.250 --> 00:11:28.120
Okay!

00:11:28.450 --> 00:11:29.660
Thank you!

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:30.620
Meow!

00:11:31.200 --> 00:11:32.870
Are you up now, Nyanko Big-san?

00:11:32.870 --> 00:11:36.950
It isn't time for lunch yet. You just ate breakfast.

00:11:39.410 --> 00:11:42.700
Chocolate, huh? I don't care for sweet things.

00:11:43.290 --> 00:11:44.910
Pick a cup you'd like to drink from.

00:11:44.910 --> 00:11:47.000
Okay, I'll take the rainbow cup!

00:11:47.370 --> 00:11:49.080
I'll take the first cup from the left.

00:11:49.080 --> 00:11:51.580
Ooh, a floral design!

00:11:52.620 --> 00:11:54.910
I'm surprised, but it suits you, Alec!

00:11:54.910 --> 00:11:56.750
Please leave me alone.

00:12:00.910 --> 00:12:01.830
Meow!

00:12:02.830 --> 00:12:07.120
What, what, whatcha readin'? Whatcha readin'?

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:10.000
Tell me! Let's read together!

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:16.160
Hey, you don't have to hide it!
You can tell me what book that is!

00:12:16.660 --> 00:12:19.290
If you don't shut your mouth, I'll shut it for you!

00:12:19.290 --> 00:12:20.160
Eep!

00:12:20.160 --> 00:12:21.370
I'll stay quiet!

00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:23.080
Here you go.

00:12:23.580 --> 00:12:25.000
Thank you very much!

00:12:25.330 --> 00:12:26.410
Thank you.

00:12:27.870 --> 00:12:29.040
Thanks, man!

00:12:29.540 --> 00:12:31.160
So, how do you use this?

00:12:31.750 --> 00:12:33.040
You take it...

00:12:34.370 --> 00:12:36.410
and mix it like so.

00:12:37.500 --> 00:12:39.700
Ah, it smells so sweet!

00:12:39.950 --> 00:12:40.790
Yeah!

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:45.330
Then, I guess I'll go with white chocolate!
How about you, Alec?

00:12:45.330 --> 00:12:47.160
Well, I'll go with strawberry.

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:48.950
Strawberry?

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:52.580
Would you like one, too, Tada-kun?

00:12:53.160 --> 00:12:54.750
I'm not a fan of sweet drinks...

00:12:55.200 --> 00:12:56.950
It's not that sweet!

00:12:56.950 --> 00:13:00.200
You're actually cutesy, huh, Alec?

00:13:00.200 --> 00:13:01.870
I'm really going to hit you!

00:13:02.250 --> 00:13:03.370
Why?!

00:13:05.620 --> 00:13:07.160
Hey, not bad.

00:13:09.330 --> 00:13:10.950
Then, I'll have one, too.

00:13:11.330 --> 00:13:12.660
Do you have any recommendations?

00:13:13.660 --> 00:13:17.450
Well... how about dark chocolate?

00:13:17.950 --> 00:13:18.700
Sure.

00:13:20.910 --> 00:13:24.580
Oh... It melts instantly, huh?

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:31.540
Man, this is friggin' good!

00:13:32.700 --> 00:13:33.790
What is the matter?

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:36.250
Nothing.

00:13:44.450 --> 00:13:49.250
Do you like sweet coffee, Miss?

00:14:03.620 --> 00:14:05.080
Nyanko Big.

00:14:06.450 --> 00:14:09.000
Hello. Are you going on a walk?

00:14:09.000 --> 00:14:10.500
Meow-meow!

00:14:09.250 --> 00:14:12.370
I'm not going on a walk, Shozo. I'm going on patrol.

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:15.160
I see. You're going on patrol, huh?

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:16.290
Meow?!
What?!

00:14:16.870 --> 00:14:20.660
Be careful. Don't go too far.

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:21.700
Meow...

00:14:21.700 --> 00:14:23.500
Shozo, you're amazing...

00:14:27.330 --> 00:14:30.200
Chinese Restaurant
Tarafuku

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:30.200
Miko-chan, are you heading out?

00:14:30.540 --> 00:14:32.620
Miko-chan, you look like you're in high spirits today.

00:14:33.080 --> 00:14:35.450
Follow the traffic signals, Miko-chan.

00:14:36.620 --> 00:14:41.080
I have absolutely no idea why people call me Miko-chan.

00:14:46.660 --> 00:14:49.290
There's nothing out of the ordinary in town.

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:55.700
Pin-senpai!

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:56.950
Hey!

00:14:57.950 --> 00:14:59.250
Listen up, my friends!

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:02.160
The deadline for the spring contest is next week!

00:15:02.160 --> 00:15:05.910
We're all going to treat today as if it's
our last day and snap pictures like mad!

00:15:06.580 --> 00:15:07.750
Okay...

00:15:11.450 --> 00:15:12.290
Yay!

00:15:15.910 --> 00:15:18.580
I believe I said that the theme was "spring."

00:15:18.580 --> 00:15:20.500
I'll take a picture of the sky...

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:23.290
Yamashita Dog! You're thinking
of going to sleep, aren't you?!

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:25.250
Wow!

00:15:25.700 --> 00:15:27.620
This is a lovely Japanese garden!

00:15:28.250 --> 00:15:30.000
It certainly is beautiful.

00:15:31.370 --> 00:15:33.580
Is this your first time here?

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:37.700
Yes! This sort of looks like a place where
Rainbow Shogun would show up.

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:39.950
I see...

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:41.250
Teresa-chan!

00:15:41.950 --> 00:15:44.120
A kappa is gonna show up here!

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:47.120
Kappa

00:15:45.160 --> 00:15:47.120
What?! The kappa you mentioned earlier?!

00:15:47.120 --> 00:15:49.410
Yeah! So, be careful!

00:15:49.700 --> 00:15:52.250
You shouldn't go near there under any circumstances!

00:15:52.580 --> 00:15:54.000
Really?

00:15:54.370 --> 00:15:56.830
Kappa don't exist.

00:15:56.830 --> 00:16:02.080
That's not true! There was one
when we first met, remember?!

00:16:02.080 --> 00:16:03.000
A kappa?

00:16:03.790 --> 00:16:08.160
It was back when we were six.
I was crazy about radio control boats...

00:16:08.160 --> 00:16:09.290
I said they don't exist.

00:16:10.540 --> 00:16:12.160
Go, go, go!

00:16:12.160 --> 00:16:13.000
Ah!

00:16:15.790 --> 00:16:16.750
Huh?

00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:19.830
I'm caught on something...

00:16:19.830 --> 00:16:22.120
Huh?! Are you okay, Kaoru-kun?!

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:23.580
Whoa!

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:25.120
It's a kappa!

00:16:25.120 --> 00:16:25.870
Kappa?!

00:16:25.870 --> 00:16:28.200
Kaoru-kun is gonna get killed by a kappa!

00:16:28.200 --> 00:16:29.040
What?!

00:16:29.040 --> 00:16:30.330
Let's run!

00:16:30.330 --> 00:16:32.910
Hey, wait! Don't leave me behind!

00:16:33.370 --> 00:16:34.950
Help!

00:16:35.330 --> 00:16:36.160
Huh?

00:16:37.000 --> 00:16:39.950
A kappa is gonna kill me!

00:16:39.950 --> 00:16:41.080
Chill out.

00:16:42.500 --> 00:16:44.200
Kappa don't exist.

00:16:45.200 --> 00:16:46.080
Here.

00:16:51.120 --> 00:16:53.870
Wow! You were super cool!

00:16:53.870 --> 00:16:56.160
That was really touching! Damn!

00:16:56.500 --> 00:16:57.370
I know, right?

00:16:57.620 --> 00:17:00.040
Well, you're lame, Ijuin-senpai.

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:00.910
How so?!

00:17:00.910 --> 00:17:04.080
It was mine and Mitsuyoshi's spectacular adventure!

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:06.830
I thought you were always dumb,
but you were dumb ever since that day.

00:17:06.830 --> 00:17:09.370
Hajime-chan, you shouldn't speak the truth.

00:17:09.370 --> 00:17:12.540
What?! I was friggin' scared!

00:17:14.450 --> 00:17:15.500
Teresa?

00:17:19.040 --> 00:17:20.620
Here, Teresa.

00:17:21.450 --> 00:17:24.410
Wow! Thanks, Alec!

00:17:32.120 --> 00:17:33.200
Wait!

00:17:34.120 --> 00:17:35.000
Teresa!

00:17:47.120 --> 00:17:48.290
Miss Teresa!

00:17:52.450 --> 00:17:59.080
Please be more considerate of
your situation... before acting!

00:18:02.410 --> 00:18:03.620
Alec...

00:18:08.410 --> 00:18:09.540
What's wrong?

00:18:10.080 --> 00:18:14.540
Well, Alec rescued me a long time ago...

00:18:16.200 --> 00:18:18.950
I did?

00:18:21.330 --> 00:18:22.700
Yes, you did.

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:26.870
Hey, you guys over there! Break's over!
We're gonna snap pictures like mad!

00:18:26.870 --> 00:18:28.000
Ah, okay!

00:18:30.410 --> 00:18:33.250
Tada, let's go home.

00:18:34.330 --> 00:18:39.540
Sorry, I'd still like to keep taking pictures,
so could you go on ahead of me?

00:18:39.910 --> 00:18:40.750
Roger.

00:18:41.160 --> 00:18:44.660
Tada-kun really loves taking pictures.

00:18:45.120 --> 00:18:48.830
Senpai's dad was a famous photographer.

00:18:49.370 --> 00:18:52.500
That's why he's aiming to become a photographer.

00:18:53.950 --> 00:18:59.410
I respect Senpai for working so hard for his dream.

00:19:01.250 --> 00:19:02.370
Meow!

00:19:03.540 --> 00:19:04.450
Oh?

00:19:06.580 --> 00:19:08.540
You're that cat...!

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:09.620
Meow!

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:13.160
You're the one that took shelter from
the rain with me, aren't you?

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:17.660
Meow... Meow, meow!

00:19:18.830 --> 00:19:20.000
Nice...

00:19:21.120 --> 00:19:22.910
Hey, if it isn't Cherry!

00:19:23.200 --> 00:19:25.000
So, your name's Cherry-chan...

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:27.000
Yamashita-kun, do you know her?

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:30.040
Yup! She's the neighborhood beauty salon's cat.

00:19:31.290 --> 00:19:34.830
Cherry...! What a lovely name!

00:19:31.910 --> 00:19:34.830
Meow, meow!

00:19:38.410 --> 00:19:42.830
I heard that if a man and a woman look each other
in the eyes for eight seconds, they'll fall in love.

00:19:42.830 --> 00:19:45.620
But I won't fall in love! I'll NEVER fall in love! I...!

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:49.370
Cherry-chan!

00:19:51.120 --> 00:19:52.080
Ah...!

00:19:52.790 --> 00:19:55.000
Meow, meow, meow, meow!

00:19:52.950 --> 00:19:54.700
Mayday! Mayday!

00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:56.120
That's...!

00:19:56.120 --> 00:19:57.410
Nyanko Big-san?!

00:19:57.410 --> 00:19:58.250
Oh, no!

00:19:58.250 --> 00:20:00.040
Nyanko Big!

00:20:00.450 --> 00:20:01.410
Meow!

00:20:12.200 --> 00:20:13.410
Are you all right?

00:20:13.750 --> 00:20:16.120
Hm. Well, he's breathing.

00:20:16.580 --> 00:20:17.580
Thank goodness...

00:20:17.580 --> 00:20:20.250
That's Nyanko Small, huh?

00:20:20.910 --> 00:20:22.450
Good one, Yamashita Dog!

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:23.620
Hiss!
Be quiet!

00:20:24.330 --> 00:20:25.080
Ah!

00:20:35.540 --> 00:20:38.370
I heard that if a man and a woman...

00:20:39.290 --> 00:20:41.450
Teresa, you aren't hurt, are you?

00:20:41.450 --> 00:20:45.540
No, I'm fine. Nyanko Big-san is fine, too.

00:20:45.910 --> 00:20:50.660
Kind young lady, I'd like to express
my gratitude. I am fine.

00:20:51.080 --> 00:20:56.950
But my heart is in pain... because I have fallen in love.

00:20:56.950 --> 00:21:00.370
What are you doing? You've leapt too much today.

00:21:00.540 --> 00:21:01.290
Meow...

00:21:02.580 --> 00:21:06.330
Love goes hand in hand with pain.

00:21:05.000 --> 00:21:07.120
You got scolded, huh, Nyanko Big?

00:21:07.120 --> 00:21:08.870
Don't you mean Nyanko Small?

00:21:11.450 --> 00:21:14.830
Tada Coffee Shop

00:21:12.620 --> 00:21:14.750
Dad, Mom...

00:21:15.660 --> 00:21:18.660
I was indebted to Mitsuyoshi for picking me up.

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:22.250
That's why I've been watching over him
with all my might this entire time.

00:21:22.790 --> 00:21:25.040
But from this day forward, it'll be difficult...

00:21:26.000 --> 00:21:27.120
because...

00:21:27.370 --> 00:21:30.250
of Cherry-chan!

00:21:31.410 --> 00:21:35.750
Alec, I heard that there was such a thing as kappa stars.

00:21:35.950 --> 00:21:37.870
That "kappa" has a different meaning.

00:21:38.290 --> 00:21:45.000
There are Bayer designations in stellar nomenclature,
and "Kappa" indicates the apparent magnitude.

00:21:41.620 --> 00:21:46.620
ALWAYS
MAKE
YOUR
HEART
RAINBOW

00:21:47.750 --> 00:21:48.870
Are you listening?

00:21:50.500 --> 00:21:53.160
Yeah, kappa live there, right?

00:21:54.580 --> 00:21:55.660
Huh?

00:22:02.120 --> 00:22:12.580
I kept wondering how long this would last

00:22:13.330 --> 00:22:23.830
I had no idea why you were so pretty that day

00:22:24.750 --> 00:22:30.080
After taking you away, someone who calls himself "God"

00:22:30.080 --> 00:22:36.040
Says that I will never see you again

00:22:36.500 --> 00:22:41.660
Where are you going? There was nothing I could do

00:22:41.660 --> 00:22:46.660
You beautiful person

00:22:47.620 --> 00:22:53.160
I miss you so much

00:22:53.410 --> 00:22:58.790
If one of my wishes were to come true

00:22:59.160 --> 00:23:04.750
I would want to hold you tight right now

00:23:04.750 --> 00:23:10.370
I only wanted to be with you forever

00:23:10.660 --> 00:23:15.580
Within my heart is a melody of a flood of tears

00:23:15.580 --> 00:23:24.250
I can't ever forget the days I spent with you

00:23:26.910 --> 00:23:28.160
Hajime-chan, you dropped...

00:23:28.160 --> 00:23:29.450
I haven't dropped yet!

00:23:29.450 --> 00:23:31.000
Here, you dropped this.

00:23:31.000 --> 00:23:32.000
Oh, sorry.

00:23:32.410 --> 00:23:33.410
Is that...?!

00:23:33.410 --> 00:23:36.330
Dropping my Hina photo collection book was
an oversight, but was there something else?

00:23:36.330 --> 00:23:39.500
Next time: Episode 4,
"Let's Pretend We Didn't See That..."

00:23:36.660 --> 00:23:40.660
Let's Pretend We Didn't See That...

00:23:39.500 --> 00:23:40.370
Please look forward to it!
